Package: aefsim
Title: Client for the AEF Trading Game
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R:
    person("Stefan", "Voigt", , "stefan.voigt@econ.ku.dk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Submit target portfolio weights to the trading game of
    Advanced Empirical Finance at the University of Copenhagen, and read
    your portfolio, performance and the leaderboard. A thin wrapper around
    the trading game's web API; the Python package of the same name has the
    same functions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/advanced-empirical-finance/aefsim
BugReports: https://github.com/advanced-empirical-finance/aefsim/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    stats,
    tibble,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
